# Check Dev Server Before Starting

Follow **`reuse-existing-dev-servers.mdc`**.

Use **shell-appropriate** checks (cmd → `netstat`/`curl`; PowerShell → same or `Get-NetTCPConnection`). Never treat a failed PowerShell-only command in cmd as “port free.” Valid Vite port: **8000** only.
